			EverglowingTiara: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Transforms you into the Princess of Light
					Maxium Focus reduced by 25
					Releases prismatic energy that orbits you and chases nearby enemies
					Hold (Unbound Key) to fire a laser
					You cannot use items while firing the laser
					The laser deals (Slots) base damage and disables summon damage
					[c/586475:(Damage scales based on max minions and sentries)]
					Press the mount button and (Unbound Key) at the same time to transform into a lacewing
					Hold LSHIFT while transformed to move slower
					As a lacewing:
					* [C/5c915d:Have a tiny hitbox and infinite flight]
					* [C/5c915d:Prismatic energy spawns more often]
					* [C/5c915d:Can phase through tiles]
					* [C/5c915d:Doubled Focus regeneration and no movement penalty]
					* [C/fe7c7c:Cannot use items (Can still use summons and passives)]
					* [C/fe7c7c:Are not protected by Defense]
					'''
				DisplayName: Everglowing Tiara
